ing still fires. Recorded follow-ups from the child, all honest: the paraphrase tail the screen does not enumerate (prompt v2.2 branch, needs its own gate series), no mobile 'Call 112' affordance for the MEDICAL_EMERGENCY_FLOOR safety code, the dark v2 pipeline (flag off) has no medical branch, and an overdose phrased as self-harm still goes to the crisis card by design.
